Third-party notices for Orchon

Orchon ships no third-party code yet.

When code from another project is copied into this repository, its licence text
is added to this file in the same commit: Archon's MIT licence with the builder
logic copied from Archon, and the licence of every bundled library.

The development dependencies named in package.json are used to check the
repository. They are not part of the installed plugin.
